WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.291 --> 00:00:03.291
- HOWDY, LONDON, I COME FROM THE OL’ U.S. OF A.

00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:04.916
- London loves mediocre Minshew! 

00:00:05.166 --> 00:00:06.500
- Hey, y'all, I fixed it!

00:00:06.666 --> 00:00:08.708
- GARDNER MINSHEW HAS SOLVED BREXIT!

00:00:09.041 --> 00:00:10.333
- Everyone loves my backup more than me.

00:00:10.625 --> 00:00:12.458
I wish someone could relate…

00:00:12.875 --> 00:00:13.875
- WELL, WELL—

00:00:16.875 --> 00:00:18.625
- How did I handle being hurt while you stole my city’s heart?

00:00:18.750 --> 00:00:19.625
By HUNTING.

00:00:19.625 --> 00:00:20.625
And prayer, of course.

00:00:20.708 --> 00:00:22.000
You just gotta relax—

00:00:22.250 --> 00:00:24.791
- I’M TELLING YOU, WENTZ PROVES IT EVERYDAY. WE SHOULD HAVE STUCK WITH
CHIP KELLY AND TAKEN MARIOT—

00:00:25.041 --> 00:00:26.916
- Not listen to local talk radio, and—

00:00:27.208 --> 00:00:27.791
- Woah.

00:00:29.166 --> 00:00:30.375
- Guys, you gotta catch that...

00:00:30.375 --> 00:00:30.916
- [Nelson Agholor:] Sorry!

00:00:31.375 --> 00:00:32.375
- YOU’RE NOT GOING TO REPLACE ME, Brendon Allen.

00:00:32.791 --> 00:00:34.041
Is it Brenden? It’s Brandon.

00:00:34.416 --> 00:00:36.125
- I replaced my backup no problem, see?

00:00:36.125 --> 00:00:37.125
AHHHHHHHHH!

00:00:37.750 --> 00:00:40.000
- Look, it’s a tense time for everyone around the league. 

00:00:40.291 --> 00:00:42.083
- The haters have @#$%!*&amp; won...

00:00:42.333 --> 00:00:44.083
- HOW DARE YOU ASK ME THAT ABOUT KRAFT!

00:00:44.125 --> 00:00:46.250
- No, no, no. I asked if he had a message for the team.

00:00:46.708 --> 00:00:49.583
- Not a question but the way you hand the ball to McCaffrey is amazing.

00:00:49.875 --> 00:00:51.000
- Yeah, I wouldn’t rush back, Nick.

00:00:51.041 --> 00:00:51.541
- Take that! 

00:00:52.625 --> 00:00:53.541
- Why do they catch it for him?

00:00:53.583 --> 00:00:54.791
- [Alshon Jeffery:] IT’S SIMPLER WHEN HE DOES IT.

00:00:55.000 --> 00:00:57.916
- I GOT MY BIG NICK ENERGY BACK!
QB1 in DUUUVALLL! 

00:00:58.291 --> 00:00:59.875
- Yeah, we’re all going to start again!

00:01:02.666 --> 00:01:06.000
- I'm Eli, and lately I've had some time to learn about the internet.

00:01:06.166 --> 00:01:08.625
You can subscribe below, whatever that means.

00:01:08.666 --> 00:01:11.083
Here let me type in Eli Manni⁠—

00:01:11.125 --> 00:01:12.791
Oh, no....

